  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini into small chunks.\n• Thinly slice capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645088ff95796aec7a0094b7/step-76513718.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• In the last 5 minutes, remove tray from oven. Sprinkle with shaved Parmesan cheese and bake until golden and crispy, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645088ff95796aec7a0094b7/step-5e5fe2dd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, place capsicum and zucchini on a second lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle over Nan's special seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645088ff95796aec7a0094b7/step-e9b5c4b2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, in a large saucepan heat the butter over medium-high heat.\n• Add the water and vegetable stock powder and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water has absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645088ff95796aec7a0094b7/step-b3045c0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the saucepan with the couscous, add baby spinach leaves, roasted zucchini and capsicum and basil pesto.\n• Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645088ff95796aec7a0094b7/step-8bcc3f7a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pesto couscous with roasted veggies between bowls. Top with roast Parmesan pumpkin.\n• Top with dill & parsley mayonnaise and flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645088ff95796aec7a0094b7/step-26ba798b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
